    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (Mitsuko's studying... I think...)
    - (Is the book she's reading part of her schoolwork, or is she just reading for
      fun again?)
    - (She's always losing herself in all her books... It's been a problem since
      elementary school, and we still haven't found a solution for it.)
    - (Well, I wouldn't want to bother her. I'll just hope she's doing something
      productive.)
